<title>USA: Famous Dave's boosts IPO terms.</title>
<headline>Famous Dave's boosts IPO terms.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Famous Dave's of America Inc has boosted terms of its initial public offering, according to underwriter RJ Steichen.</p>
<p>The company will sell 2.3 million units at $6.50 each. It had previously planned to sell 2.0 million units at $6 to $7 each.</p>
<p>The IPO is tentatively scheduled for the week of October 14.</p>
</text>
